WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.540
B yeelame tɩ pĩnd wẽndẽ, sa-kãseng wakate, rao-rãmb sẽn da zoe n yaa komã ra kẽnda tẽn-zẽmsã n baood koom.

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:14.259
B yeelame tɩ yaa zĩm-dãmb la b tall-b n wa zĩ-kãnga.

00:00:14.339 --> 00:00:21.247
Sẽn na yɩl n wilg b mi-beoogo, rao-rãmbã pʋlmame tɩ b pa na n maan-b wẽng ye.

00:00:21.327 --> 00:00:25.512
Rẽ n so t'a Zeova zoodã kell n kell n paasdame.
